{"server":"tw","storyId":"act39side_level_act39side_03_beg","groupId":"act39side","stageId":"act39side_03","title":"大出血的舞步","storyCode":"EP-3","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"eda992bea70a3cdf7b254be24dda02132a6509d4d7c65ea7fc67603f551dac02","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g11_meetingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小哈，很感激你為我帶來晚餐，非常美味，我很喜歡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜女士……我有些疑問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"講吧，你在我面前不必遮掩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，我們的人力不足，但這次圍獵卻要選擇如此巨大的鹽鱗作為獵殺目標，實在是有些……冒險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去追小規模的鹽鱗群，會更保險一點吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們最近追到的鹽鱗群，少得有點太可憐了。之後的煉金會需要大量的材料，我們得提早做準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經為此準備了很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遠遠不夠，有了羅盤才只是開始，進入海洋我們需要更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前任廚師波茲曾和我講過，您總是會做出一些瘋狂的決定，大部分會使人感到熱血沸騰，但有些……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卻讓人覺得如墜冰窟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我忠誠的老下屬，無論我做出什麼樣的決定，他總是支持我。就算是那些讓他膽寒的事情，他也義無反顧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜女士，您希望我也那樣做嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然不，所以他卸任，你成為了我的新廚師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小哈，你真的甘心永遠留在這裡過這種為眼前日子苦惱的生活嗎？這是難得的機會，只要抓住牠，我們就能一勞永逸解決所有麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那片海洋哺育了整個黃金時代的富商與豪門，而我們船隊的規模甚至比不上二手商販的私船隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這片鹽漠也哺育了我們整整幾十年啊！這麼多年，雖然艱辛，但你都帶著我們撐到現在了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鹽漠於我們而言實在過於貧瘠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但海洋於我們而言實在是過於危險了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小哈，想想小鎮裡的人，他們恨不得將我們除之後快，如今他們的圍剿步步緊逼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜女士，但你以前從沒有害怕過他們啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我害怕的不是他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我害怕的是鹽漠，這裡的生態要崩潰了，小哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那次地裂……正是一種預兆，探險隊之前報告給我，由於地下的暗河枯竭，鹽漠下方出現了大量空洞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空洞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暗河瀕臨乾涸，其中的微生物數量在銳減……以微生物群為食的鹽鱗數量也在驟減。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……捕鱗船已經很久沒有遇到大型的鹽鱗群落了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您為什麼不告訴我們呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我該怎麼說？再不離開，我們馬上就要完蛋了？這只會在船隊中徒增恐慌，小哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首領，這是我們目前唯一的辦法嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是啊，唯一的辦法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左邊一點……謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寶寶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……再踩用力一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寶寶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哧——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和魯斯先生學了一整天，想不到在這裡捕捉鹽鱗這麼艱難……肩膀好痛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶……對，就是那個地方，好痠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在伊西多不斷的倒吸氣聲中，他背上的寶寶踩得更加奮力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寶寶……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寶寶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哧哼哧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，說了你也不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我不是不想幫你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小時候，有乞丐教我幾個粗略的戲法，用來哄騙行人要點吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後來認識了老師，他告訴我那不是什麼戲法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是煉金術啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寶寶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哧……哼哧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛開始學習煉金術時，我對它著迷不已，過程中不斷的成功換來了老師的誇獎、同伴的認可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更好的是，我感覺到自己不再是一無所有的流浪兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是一個有點價值的人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到我得知了那支煉金流派最本質的特徵……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊西多停頓片刻，寶寶也停下踩踏，疑惑地抬起腦袋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"感受到伊西多的沮喪，寶寶輕輕趴在他的背上，發出淺淺的哼唧聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魯斯說得對，你們也只是一群想好好過日子的人，修復羅盤進入海洋……徒增風險，不值得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過話說回來……真好奇啊，胡安娜手裡的那枚羅盤到底是什麼構造……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它搭載的“心相原質”……難道真如傳聞中那般，可以指向人心中最為嚮往的事物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果能研究一下的話……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寶寶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睡著了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我很好奇，我的心中到底在想什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"花？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種花是亞諾阿醫生最先在鎮上開始栽種的，種了幾十年……做藥膏用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……我在頌聖棱堡灰暗的廳堂裡，也曾看過這種花好幾次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒去過頌聖棱堡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道，在雅隆被海水圍困了那麼多年之後，覆滿鹽漬的土地上最先開出的，就是這種花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前，常有鎮民送這種花給我，大概是為了表示感謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，我覺得也應當為您送上一束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我怎麼配？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是您對幾支商隊採取了那樣的……手段，拿到了兇猛迅捷的恐馱獸……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是沒辦法深入鹽漠去圍剿那些十惡不赦的強盜的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那只是我必須要做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的義務，當然……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您之前提過，此行主要是為了追繳被強盜偷走的禁物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恕我好奇，是什麼樣的禁物，值得您千里迢迢來到這片廢土？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個……羅盤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但伊比利亞有成千上萬個舊時代的羅盤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯獨這一個，能腐化人心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它能指向使用者內心深處埋藏的慾望……至少人們相信它能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而一旦人開始看向自己內心的慾望……就再也無法回頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最終，那股慾望會驅使人去偷盜、去劫掠、去謀殺，即使想停止，也已經無能為力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……您是這樣認為的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這便是真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您最近這段時間為鎮民們布的道……也都是這些內容？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，並非我向他們布道。這裡的人們本來就理解這些真相，他們甚至理解得比我更深刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"似乎曾有一位真正的布道者，為他們揭示過這些真相。那就是您，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾經的那些禁令，也都是我頒布的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您為何不再布道？又為何撤銷了禁令？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看這座城鎮。商隊帶來的那些新奇的貨物與技術，人們碰都不敢碰一下。每天到黃昏之後，沒有人敢踏出家門半步……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們甚至不敢吃得太飽……哪怕在食物充足的年分也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當年用來控制這些可憐人的每一句話，如今都還扼在他們的咽喉上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但鎮民們並不是這樣說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道不正是您當年的所作所為，幫他們放下了對榮華富貴的幻想與哀嘆，鼓勵著他們拿起了鋤頭和鐮刀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時代不一樣了，執裁官閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時代永遠不會變，西爾弗閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"任何人在任何時候，都不該探求自己內心深處埋藏的慾望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"永遠，不該。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g3_newdeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"報告！前方發現鹽鱗痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"寬度兩公尺，長度十八公尺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可是條大傢伙，看來我們要滿載而歸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓他們準備好鱗叉，滿速行駛，追上牠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左滿舵，全速前進！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"朋友們，握緊手中的鱗叉♪\n那龐然大物在波濤中翻滾♪\n船板在我們的踩踏下轟鳴作響♪\n我們的吼叫敵過風的尖嘯♪\n追上牠！♪\n太陽落下前，我們要追上牠♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g3_newdeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，你這個小子躲在角落看什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心，船很晃。不過這是好事，震動越劇烈說明我們離牠越近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首領把你安排去哪裡了？留在這裡收網，還是去鹽地裡圍捕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜女士沒讓我下船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不懂，你的劍法不錯，參與圍捕能派上更大的用場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她沒有交代我具體要做什麼，只說能做到什麼就盡力去做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，首領做事一直以來都很仔細。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就當作是新手的工作標準一直都比較寬鬆？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g3_newdeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看見牠了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"去你的鱗屎坨子……好大一條……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"把小艇降下去！別讓牠跑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別急，等等，牠要轉身了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快！快點轉彎！牠要朝我們撞過來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——大傢伙，你今天心情不好是嗎？但我今天的心情很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小珍珠，計劃有變，讓哈維爾留在船上，我下去指揮圍獵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夫人，但是距您上次親自參與圍獵已經過去很長一段時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小珍珠，照我說的做！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈維爾，回來！現在由你掌舵！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，這樣太冒險了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小哈，牠不是你能對付得了的，留在船上，我需要你配合我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那……我該怎麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到那處舌形鹽礁了嗎？用粗鹽彈把牠趕到那裡，剩下的交給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遵命，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"急轉彎！都抓緊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鹽船急轉船頭向右偏移，可惜還是慢了一步，擦著直直衝來的鹽鱗勉強躲過攻擊。\n甲板上的眾人聽著衝撞聲冷汗直冒，伊西多則緊抓欄杆，向聲音傳來的方向望去。\n他看到一隻龐大的鹽鱗從艦船旁游過，揚起的鹽粒散落甲板，打在臉上隱隱作痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……牠竟然能長到這麼大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為之前見過的那隻就是極限了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，小子，就連我……也沒見過這麼大的鹽鱗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不到萬不得已，捕鱗船斷然不會將如此巨大的鹽鱗作為目標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，追捕牠絕對會讓我們得不償失。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g3_newdeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上膛！預備！點火！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左舷開炮！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"往牠的呼吸孔和眼睛開炮！光打外殼是沒辦法讓牠恐慌的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜女士呢，她就位了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首領！首領！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她剛剛下船了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽好了，你們得停止這次的捕獵，否則代價是我們無法承擔的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們停止狩獵，之後的食物要怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魯斯！你發現什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那隻巨鱗的體型要比牠的同類大了不止一倍，一般情況下只有族群中的領袖能長到這麼大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按理說，牠的身後應該跟著整整一群鹽鱗，但這裡卻只有牠一條。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，鹽鱗專家，直接告訴我們結論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠要嘛是失去了自己的族群，要嘛是被族群拋棄，但結果都一樣，牠現在應該異常暴躁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜女士知道這件事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她制定了捕獵的計劃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是在拿我們所有人的生命冒險，如果那條鹽鱗決定和我們同歸於盡，沒有人能——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂奇，你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夫人已經帶領圍捕的人走遠了，現在沒有其他的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魯斯的話切勿透露給其他船員，我們不能自亂陣腳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續開炮，哈維爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我寧可死在此次的狩獵中，也不願意一個月後活活餓死。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g1_saltdesert_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1592_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首領……我們能對付這個大傢伙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我們會贏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓準時機，等牠轉彎的時候，對準外殼上的縫隙投擲鱗叉！當然，你要是能投進呼吸孔裡，那更好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1592_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠朝我們的方向過來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用力划槳，衝上去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，女士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鱗叉準備！……投擲！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好！繼續保持！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1592_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠的力氣太大，我快要拉不住繩索了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來幫你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人——繼續投擲！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船員們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，有人投中呼吸孔了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓緊繩索！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船員們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繩索還剩三十公尺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還剩二十公尺！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還剩十公尺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1592_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，繩索不夠了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再等等！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠支撐不住浮出鹽層了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是現在，用力，收緊繩索！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"繩索收起，胡安娜駕駛著小艇緩緩靠近了那條鹽鱗，牠厚實的皮膚被數十支鱗叉穿透，傷口汩汩流淌鮮血。\n聽到鹽鱗粗重短促的呼吸聲，胡安娜知道牠已經走到盡頭了。\n她忍不住撫上那龐大的身軀，感受生命從中一點點流失，直到鹽鱗不甘心地閉上眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1592_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……終於結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們成功了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……讓鹽船來接應我們吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1592_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快後退，女士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠沒死……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一道視線，懷著惡意，籠罩了胡安娜。\n她對上視線的主人，被眼睛裡濃重的怨恨和憤怒震撼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"下一秒，鹽鱗暴起，地面上沾著血液的鹽粒被濺起，如同雨點般落在船員身上。\n繩索被悉數掙斷，只剩下幾十支鱗叉還插在牠的身上。\n掙脫束縛的一刻，牠高高揚起尾鰭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1592_1","isRemote":false,"text":"撤退！快，撤退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在鹽鱗的攻擊下，幾隻小艇被攔腰折斷，受傷的船員哀嚎不斷。\n慘烈的尖叫聲裡，胡安娜像是下定了某種決心。她向狂暴的鹽鱗奔去，抓住牠背上的一根鱗叉。\n感受到背上的胡安娜，鹽鱗猛地躍起身，試圖將她甩落下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣太危險了，女士，鬆手吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，只要我沒死，牠就還是我的獵物！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"衝開擋在前面的小艇，鹽鱗帶著胡安娜游向遠方。\n速度很快，像離弦的箭，又或是垂死的星星。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g3_newdeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再快點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們得追上那頭畜生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下來！停下來！我們不能再繼續往前追了！那個畜生把胡安娜拖進了骸礁峽谷！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈維爾……哈維爾……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你醒了，魯斯。抱歉，你是對的，我不該就那麼打暈你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的事也不是一次兩次了，蒂奇，你那個脾氣我也不是沒有領教過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這次你們真的都要聽我的，不能再繼續行駛了……骸礁峽谷裡噴發的蒸汽可以輕易撕碎我們的船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們不願意去，那給我一艘小艇，讓我去找她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒人能從裡面活著出來！不管是我們還是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，她是胡安娜，我知道她可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂奇，你要跟著我去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別衝動，哈維爾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算放任她去死嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡沒有人希望失去首領，哈維爾，但我們不能再失去你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是她看好的孩子，如果她出了事，之後你有該肩負的責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我帶人去就夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說得對，蒂奇，但她不會死，我不會讓她死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有誰要跟我去？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大膽的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠誠的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"讓我去，可以嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"人群中響起一個聲音，船員們分開兩邊，露出後面的伊西多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，這不是我們的煉金術師嗎？我還以為你打算繼續默不作聲呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底有什麼用，小子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以幫你們活著走出峽谷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g1_saltdesert_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"習武教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西爾弗閣下，我們已經準備好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。等我命令，將他們一網打盡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"習武教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……執裁官閣下，您確定那群強盜會經過這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……他們的物資儲備情況並不理想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在鹽漠裡，他們唯一的食物來源就是鹽鱗，根據商隊給我的線索……這是他們捕鱗歸來必經的狹道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一場狩獵下來，他們只會精疲力竭，不是我們的對手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等這次埋伏成功，這一切也就可以結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能拿到強盜手裡的技術與物資……小鎮也會變好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對吧，安納斯塔西奧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"安納斯塔西奧好像含糊地說了一句什麼，但西爾弗沒有聽清楚。\n西爾弗只是充滿希望地望著眼前廣闊的鹽漠，好像從那裡看到了小鎮欣欣向榮的未來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
